@base = http://localhost:5080/v1/admin
@officer = <allocation_officer access token>

### #109 Backlog
GET {{base}}/allocation/backlog
Authorization: Bearer {{officer}}

### #110 Units (FIFO)
GET {{base}}/allocation/products/{{productId}}/units?status=awaiting_allocation
Authorization: Bearer {{officer}}

### #111 Candidates
GET {{base}}/allocation/products/{{productId}}/candidates?zakatOnly=false
Authorization: Bearer {{officer}}

### #112 Allocate
POST {{base}}/allocation/products/{{productId}}/allocate
Authorization: Bearer {{officer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"beneficiaryIds":["{{beneficiaryId}}"],"note":"دفعة سبتمبر — القصيم"}

### #113 Batch
GET {{base}}/allocation/batches/{{batchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{officer}}

### #114 Complete a book copy
POST {{base}}/units/{{unitId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{officer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"deliveredOn":"2026-09-30"}

### Jobs (dev)
POST http://localhost:5080/dev/jobs/LapseUnitsJob/run
